      "text" : "√ Our Solution"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960000000000008,
        364.05924479999999,
        425.20069903024648,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "We can’t always evenly divide the exponent on a variable by 2. Sometimes we"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960000000000036,
        349.41904479999999,
        425.20141839692803,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "have a remainder. If there is a remainder, this means the remainder is left inside"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 11.955200000000001,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        84.960000000000036,
        334.65924480000001,
        425.21829729812475,
        11.979110400000025
      ],
      "text" : "the radical, and the whole number part is how many are outside the radical. This"
    },
